---
description: >-
  Switching between `autonumber both`, `autonumber off` and `autonumber`, which
  keeps counting unless a new start is given, together with decimals and the
  smaller font for long numbers.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  Alice->>Bob: Not numbered yet
  autonumber both 10 5
  Alice->>Bob: 10 and 15
  Bob->>Bob: 20
  autonumber off
  Alice->>Bob: Not numbered
  autonumber
  Alice->>Bob: One number
  autonumber both
  Bob->>Alice: Two numbers again
  autonumber both 1.1 0.1
  Alice->>Bob: 1.1 and 1.2
  Bob->>Alice: 1.3 and 1.4
  autonumber both 999
  Alice->>Bob: 999 and 1000
  autonumber both 99999
  Bob->>Alice: 99999 and 100000
